## Interface: 30300
## Title: Ascension Vanity Tracker
## Notes: Shows vanity item drops in creature tooltips with region info
## Author: CTout
## Version: 2.2-dev
## SavedVariables: AscensionVanityDB, AscensionVanityDump

# Shared constants (loads first - used by all other files)
AscensionVanityConstants.lua

# Configuration (loads second, sets defaults)
AscensionVanityConfig.lua

# Database files (V2 format - consolidated icon index in VanityDB.lua)
VanityDB.lua

# Database loader (provides lookup functions)
VanityDB_Loader.lua

# API Scanner (in-game data export tool)
APIScanner.lua

# User Interface (settings and scanner panels)
SettingsUI.lua
ScannerUI.lua

# Regional Hunting Guide (v2.1+ zone-based item finder)
RegionalGuide.lua

# Core functionality
Core.lua
